(text "HIN/LIN: TIMER0 CH0/1/2 and complementary outputs.\nSPI1_* connector nets use GD32 SPI0 on PA4..PA7.\nQEI1_*: TIMER2 on PC6..PC8. ADC inputs on PA0..3, PC0..5.\nVCC=3.3V; AVCC=3.3V analog; AGND linked to GND by R3.\nExternal crystal and application-specific PWM auxiliary net: pending." (at 150 92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1b2f3994-a87d-4baf-a7a6-8185ca0046c8"))

