(text "MCU local decoupling: C200..204 one per VDD; C205 bulk.\nC206..208 analog/reference decoupling. R200/C209 reset.\nR201/R202 boot pulldowns. J200 SWD. Internal clock startup.\nPlace decouplers beside respective supply pins during PCB design." (at 150 195 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "12296737-fcce-4025-be39-2a8eac5f3345"))

(text "Alternate functions: PA8/9/10 AF1; PB13/14 AF2; PB15 AF1.\nSPI0 PA4..7 AF0. TIMER2 PC6..8 AF0.\nReference: official GD32EB F505VxT7.xml and AFIO GD32F505.xml." (at 150 218 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "13937bae-3ece-4c26-a0e4-fe8c35aa1798"))
